## Conclusion

Catalog valuation is an exercise in revenue architecture, not algorithmic chasing. By aligning SKU packaging with high-intent collector demand, heritage labels can unlock untapped pricing power, protect asset margins, and convert passive streaming fans into high-yield owners.

